WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.137
I've seen it all.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.440
- The thing is,
Forest is a unique child.

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:08.808
- Everything is gonna be fine.

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:10.243
I want you to have
a good time tonight.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.511
You deserve it.

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:13.046
Okay, um...

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:15.749
- Good luck.
- Thank you.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:34.401
- Goo-goo ga-ga.

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:40.473
- Hey there, Forest.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:43.409
- Goo-goo ga-ga.

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:45.478
I want...

00:00:45.511 --> 00:00:47.447
I want milk.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.382
- You want me to get you
your bottle, buddy?

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:50.683
- I want milk!
- Okay.

00:00:56.655 --> 00:00:58.091
- This is a ba-ba.

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.828
I want mama's milk.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:03.430
Why can't I have mama's milk?

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.399
It's a simple request.

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.534
- Well, yeah, well, uh, y...

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.470
you can't have Mama's milk
right now, buddy.

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.505
Um, how about we play?

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:13.573
- Okay.

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.374
I want...

00:01:15.407 --> 00:01:18.144
I want...
I wanna play with my Legos.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:19.612
- Okay, yeah.

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:22.582
Okay, buddy, let's, uh,
get your Legos then.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.417
- I wanna...

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.487
I wanna put the smallest Lego
in my mouth.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.621
- That's what I'm gonna do.
- No, no, no.

00:01:28.654 --> 00:01:29.655
You can't... You can't do that.

00:01:29.688 --> 00:01:31.324
- What?

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.260
First you tell me
I can't have Mama's milk.

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:37.530
Now I can't have
the smallest Lego in my mouth?

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:39.365
What a night.

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:41.501
This is a bad start.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.569
- Wait, but Forest,
it's dangerous.

00:01:43.602 --> 00:01:45.138
- Let me get this straight.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.374
You're in charge of me?
In my house?

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:49.909
- All right, Forest,
it's time for bed.

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:53.346
- I guess then
you gonna sing me a song.

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:55.148
- What?

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.717
- Momma always sings me a song
before I go to sleep.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.186
Are you gonna do that for me?

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:02.222
Okay, okay. Yeah. Yes, I will.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:08.494
♪ Hush, little baby
don't say a word-- ♪

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:10.796
- Keep... keep singing.

00:02:10.829 --> 00:02:14.433
♪ Mama's gonna buy you
a mockingbird-- ♪

00:02:14.466 --> 00:02:16.502
- Put my name in it.

00:02:16.535 --> 00:02:19.238
I like... I like it personal.

00:02:19.271 --> 00:02:23.609
♪ Hush, baby Forest Whitaker
don't say a word-- ♪

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:25.278
- Goo-goo ga-ga.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:28.814
♪ Mama's gonna buy you
a mockingbird-- ♪

00:02:28.847 --> 00:02:30.449
- Good babysitter.

00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:33.753
♪ And if that mockingbird
don't sing-- ♪

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:36.189
- Have a good cry.

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.692
♪ Mama's gonna buy you
a diamond ring. ♪

